(7671842, 1252754, 104230, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!</td>', 'Magnificent!', '2020-08-08 01:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671843, 1252570, 104230, '<td valign="top">That''s the kind of image I was hoping for! A close up of textures, a lovely sense of shapes/contours, and the stem holding it all together.<br/> <br/>I''d be curious to find out how this was lit.</td>', 'That''s the kind of image I was hoping for! A close up of textures, a lovely sense of shapes/contours, and the stem holding it all together. I''d be curious to find out how this was lit.', '2020-08-08 01:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671914, 1252670, 100831, '<td valign="top">Love the bright colors... not sure about the crop, but I don''t mean that in a bad way.</td>', 'Love the bright colors... not sure about the crop, but I don''t mean that in a bad way.', '2020-08-09 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671928, 1252749, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely, moody, intimate high key image.  Wonderful composition.  Cropped down emotionally as well to compelling, primal feelings.  Moving. Hard to turn away from.  Assuming the title is correctly spelled, it''s marvelous.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Lovely, moody, intimate high key image.  Wonderful composition.  Cropped down emotionally as well to compelling, primal feelings.  Moving. Hard to turn away from.  Assuming the title is correctly spelled, it''s marvelous.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-08-09 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671930, 1252751, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and focus on this sleek soul.  An wearing a turtleneck to boot!  Fascinating clarity of pattern on the head, fading on back and legs into a dreamy maze.  Excellent.</td>', 'Nice crop and focus on this sleek soul.  An wearing a turtleneck to boot!  Fascinating clarity of pattern on the head, fading on back and legs into a dreamy maze.  Excellent.', '2020-08-10 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671932, 1252707, 173844, '<td valign="top">Stunning immediacy.  Wonderful focus that allows the latter parts of the wings to fade to smoky abstraction.  Not just a butterfly but this butterfly.</td>', 'Stunning immediacy.  Wonderful focus that allows the latter parts of the wings to fade to smoky abstraction.  Not just a butterfly but this butterfly.', '2020-08-10 00:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671933, 1252725, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and shapes underpin this fine composition.  The sprawling people work well in their placement.  If you realize that a picture of the earth floating in space can be cropped down to Asia, there shouldn''t be any issue with this.  Serenely harmonious.</td>', 'Lovely colors and shapes underpin this fine composition.  The sprawling people work well in their placement.  If you realize that a picture of the earth floating in space can be cropped down to Asia, there shouldn''t be any issue with this.  Serenely harmonious.', '2020-08-10 00:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671934, 1252721, 173844, '<td valign="top">Love this beautifully captured candid portrait, ruffled feathers, food on his or her beak.  Also neat how we can sense the energy going into the grooming.  Balanced in the center so well.<br/>Wouldn''t want you around when I''m picking my nose.</td>', 'Love this beautifully captured candid portrait, ruffled feathers, food on his or her beak.  Also neat how we can sense the energy going into the grooming.  Balanced in the center so well.Wouldn''t want you around when I''m picking my nose.', '2020-08-10 00:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671935, 1252570, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific revelatory image of the top of an apple.  The steep plunge to the very center is dizzying.  The stem is like an umbilicus, or a biblical snake.  The detail is very satisfying.  I like how the edges of the texture delicately catch the light.  You have a promising future in fruit, or whatever you choose to reveal.</td>', 'Terrific revelatory image of the top of an apple.  The steep plunge to the very center is dizzying.  The stem is like an umbilicus, or a biblical snake.  The detail is very satisfying.  I like how the edges of the texture delicately catch the light.  You have a promising future in fruit, or whatever you choose to reveal.', '2020-08-10 00:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671936, 1252395, 100831, '<td valign="top">A great close up! Congrats on getting this with all the detail, etc.</td>', 'A great close up! Congrats on getting this with all the detail, etc.', '2020-08-10 00:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671937, 1252751, 100831, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile.  LOVE the b/w and crop, 8</td>', 'This makes me smile.  LOVE the b/w and crop, 8', '2020-08-10 00:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671938, 1252625, 100831, '<td valign="top">Maybe not the closest crop, but an interesting view and I love the grays and details.</td>', 'Maybe not the closest crop, but an interesting view and I love the grays and details.', '2020-08-10 00:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671939, 1252755, 173844, '<td valign="top">Luscious, seductive pink.  A sultry boudoir, shimmering and iridescent.  An open heart.  Simply delightful.</td>', 'Luscious, seductive pink.  A sultry boudoir, shimmering and iridescent.  An open heart.  Simply delightful.', '2020-08-10 00:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671940, 1252754, 100831, '<td valign="top">Bump for the colors, detail, crop and the light.</td>', 'Bump for the colors, detail, crop and the light.', '2020-08-10 00:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671942, 1252752, 100831, '<td valign="top">Awesome light. Bump to 8</td>', 'Awesome light. Bump to 8', '2020-08-10 00:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671943, 1252752, 173844, '<td valign="top">I like the aggressivenes of this yellow and red flower.  The close crop imbues it with power.  I also like the intensity of the blown highlights, showing it to be a cousin to the sun.  Quite a statement.</td>', 'I like the aggressivenes of this yellow and red flower.  The close crop imbues it with power.  I also like the intensity of the blown highlights, showing it to be a cousin to the sun.  Quite a statement.', '2020-08-10 00:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671944, 1252337, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice one.</td>', 'Nice one.', '2020-08-10 00:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671945, 1252562, 100831, '<td valign="top">Great crop. I know these things well.</td>', 'Great crop. I know these things well.', '2020-08-10 00:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671946, 1252707, 100831, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and the colors are awesome.</td>', 'Nice DOF and the colors are awesome.', '2020-08-10 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671947, 1252788, 100831, '<td valign="top">sweeeeet</td>', 'sweeeeet', '2020-08-10 00:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671948, 1252472, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  The leaf and the caterpillar seem to form a ying and a yang, a spiritual tango.  Handsome and compelling.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  The leaf and the caterpillar seem to form a ying and a yang, a spiritual tango.  Handsome and compelling.', '2020-08-10 00:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671949, 1252750, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine capture with great depth of detail.  Beautiful color palette.  The shapes add up to a nice composition.</td>', 'Fine capture with great depth of detail.  Beautiful color palette.  The shapes add up to a nice composition.', '2020-08-10 00:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671950, 1252788, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fine high key minimalism.  The nose and darker lines are a suggestion for the viewer to bring to life, and it''s worth the effort.</td>', 'Fine high key minimalism.  The nose and darker lines are a suggestion for the viewer to bring to life, and it''s worth the effort.', '2020-08-10 00:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671951, 1252777, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice title that seems immediately appropriate.  Here''s a tank with all the insect accoutrements of full on assault.  Highlighted as you show it, we can admire the delicate perfection of nature''s genius.  Strong.</td>', 'Nice title that seems immediately appropriate.  Here''s a tank with all the insect accoutrements of full on assault.  Highlighted as you show it, we can admire the delicate perfection of nature''s genius.  Strong.', '2020-08-10 00:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671952, 1252439, 173844, '<td valign="top">Yes, I feel it.  Sometimes it seems that there''s only so much you can do with water, but here you''ve a fascinating play of currents and colors, textures and flow.  Elegant rocky spur.</td>', 'Yes, I feel it.  Sometimes it seems that there''s only so much you can do with water, but here you''ve a fascinating play of currents and colors, textures and flow.  Elegant rocky spur.', '2020-08-10 00:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671953, 1252451, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely, cheery confection.  A furry, adorable butterfly (as I think it is).  The colors work, and we''re charmed by its inviting presence.  The purple on the right serves as a gentle counterbalance to the right hand intensity.  Very nice.</td>', 'A lovely, cheery confection.  A furry, adorable butterfly (as I think it is).  The colors work, and we''re charmed by its inviting presence.  The purple on the right serves as a gentle counterbalance to the right hand intensity.  Very nice.', '2020-08-10 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671954, 1252776, 173844, '<td valign="top">Simple and handsome.</td>', 'Simple and handsome.', '2020-08-10 00:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7671955, 1252763, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely greens and dynamic shapes.  Great sense of anticipation, awakening, revelation.</td>', 'Lovely greens and dynamic shapes.  Great sense of anticipation, awakening, revelation.', '2020-08-10 00:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
