(7671964, 1252741, 173844, '<td valign="top">Your story makes the picture.  I respect the restraint of your title.  Mine would be more like "Lemon-brained Asshole Darkens The Sky With Selfishness, Stupidity And A Treachorous Tendency To Lick Toads In The Hot Sun, A Weeping Sore On The Body Of Humanity."  That''s just the prologue.  So glad it didn''t turn uglier.</td>', 'Your story makes the picture.  I respect the restraint of your title.  Mine would be more like "Lemon-brained Asshole Darkens The Sky With Selfishness, Stupidity And A Treachorous Tendency To Lick Toads In The Hot Sun, A Weeping Sore On The Body Of Humanity."  That''s just the prologue.  So glad it didn''t turn uglier.', '2020-08-10 02:08:28.000000', NULL, 0),
